{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moon Tropica is a free-to-play, top-down, hack and slash PVP fighter. Team up with, or play against friends using a wide array of powerful weapons in a variety of unique, dynamic maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/Columns.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the adventurous, energetic, heart-pounding battle arenas where strategy, skill, and determination are put to the ultimate test. Earn XP progression, complete quests, conquer challenges, and receive rewards all while customizing your fully dynamic character from head-to-toe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>POWERFUL ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By any means necessary! Open chests and loot your opponents for a variety of special weapons ranging from boomerangs, bows, elemental staffs, and the ever-so-powerful 'Zuka'. Strategically use objects and dynamic elements from around the map to eliminate your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXCITING GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/Fight.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fend for yourself, eliminate all of the other opponents, and show them who's boss in the ultra fast paced Free-For-All, and 5 Lives game modes. If you're looking for more strategy, team up with friends and dominate the other team in Team Deathmatch and King Of The Hill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VIBRANT COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/Dancing.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the fight and meet other players on the battlefield. Express yourself with a variety of emotes and utilize the\u00a0 seamless text chat. Whether you want to play solo, or with a group of friends, there is always a new experience that awaits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664890?t=1745948250","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664890?t=1745948250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/7caba8bcc081d1cc137ab78a240081c637e6b9d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745948250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/7caba8bcc081d1cc137ab78a240081c637e6b9d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745948250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moon Tropica is a free-to-play, top-down, hack and slash PVP fighter. Team up with, or play against friends using a wide array of powerful weapons in a variety of unique, dynamic maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/Columns.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the adventurous, energetic, heart-pounding battle arenas where strategy, skill, and determination are put to the ultimate test. Earn XP progression, complete quests, conquer challenges, and receive rewards all while customizing your fully dynamic character from head-to-toe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>POWERFUL ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By any means necessary! Open chests and loot your opponents for a variety of special weapons ranging from boomerangs, bows, elemental staffs, and the ever-so-powerful 'Zuka'. Strategically use objects and dynamic elements from around the map to eliminate your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXCITING GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/Fight.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fend for yourself, eliminate all of the other opponents, and show them who's boss in the ultra fast paced Free-For-All, and 5 Lives game modes. If you're looking for more strategy, team up with friends and dominate the other team in Team Deathmatch and King Of The Hill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VIBRANT COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/Dancing.gif?t=1745948250\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the fight and meet other players on the battlefield. Express yourself with a variety of emotes and utilize the\u00a0 seamless text chat. Whether you want to play solo, or with a group of friends, there is always a new experience that awaits.</p>","developers":["Regarded Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/650efbea6e1bfaacd645213728331daa2e2f5df3/header.jpg?t=1745948250","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_r